    <main>
        <section>
            <h2>About Mercedes</h2>
            <img src="images/placeholder-mercedes.jpg" alt="Mercedes" style="max-width: 300px; border-radius: 10px;">
            
            <h3>My Journey</h3>
            <p>I'm Mercedes, a certified dog trainer and behavior consultant from Buenos Aires, Argentina. After studying biology, dog behavior, and dog training in Germany, I've dedicated myself to modern, science-based training methods that prioritize compassion and empathy for both dogs and their humans.</p>
            
            <h3>My Philosophy</h3>
            <p>My training methods are as modern as they get, based not only on science but also, and not less importantly, on compassion and empathy. I believe that understanding the dog's perspective and emotions is essential to creating lasting, positive behavioral changes.</p>
            
            <h3>Certifications & Qualifications</h3>
            <div class="certification">
                <p><strong>Education:</strong> Biology, Dog Behavior, Dog Training - Germany</p>
            </div>
            <div class="certification">
                <p><strong>Location:</strong> Mannheim, Germany (Online coaching available worldwide)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="certification">
                <p><strong>Approach:</strong> Science-based, modern, compassionate training methods</p>
            </div>
            
            <h3>Why Work With Me?</h3>
            <ul style="margin-left: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;">
                <li>Evidence-based training methods backed by behavioral science</li>
                <li>Personalized approach tailored to your dog's unique needs</li>
                <li>Focus on the human-dog relationship and mutual understanding</li>
                <li>Flexible scheduling with online and in-person options</li>
                <li>Compassionate, patient, and supportive coaching</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </main>
